# Using the &quot;Economics U$A&quot; Telecourse within the Traditional Microeconomics Course.

**Authors:** Alavi, Jafar, And Others

## Abstract
A control group of 31 received traditional microeconomics instruction; 20 experimentals viewed the Economics U$A telecourse with lecture, discussion, and textbook. Pre/posttest data demonstrated no significant differences in comprehension of content or in cognitive level, although the video group did do better in the area of implicit application. (SK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ475353

